<title>SWEDEN: TI Group says has Swedish Forsheda go-ahead.</title>
<headline>TI Group says has Swedish Forsheda go-ahead.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's TI Group said it had received approval from Konkurrensverket, Sweden's anti-trust authority, to proceed with the purchase of Swedish polymer group Forsheda. -- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
